WEBVTT

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.500
Neigh... Neigh...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.200
The game this time is exceedingly simple.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:30.120
It will take place in these remote ruins
of 13th Avenue's Dry Dry Desert.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.540
You are to venture to the
deepest depths of these ruins...

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.120
...and obtain Chromosome 05 from the guard.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.870
That is all.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.830
Huh? That's it?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:45.500
However, only two Let's Players
may participate this time.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.250
What's more, it must be
a female and male pair.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.330
Now then, it's heart-throbbing,
couple-making time!

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:12.000
"The Ones Within"

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.580
"Winner"

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:40.000
Ain't it a bit rude to be crying?!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.540
And why the hell are you only scared of me?!

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:45.120
Hey now! Quit teasing Himiko!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.160
I ain't teasing her! I should be the one crying!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:51.870
Mr. Kudou, I'm a very good person.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:55.450
I would never go berserk
with jealousy and harm you.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:58.660
"Curse"
But tomorrow, you'll chow down on pepper death!

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.950
"Curse"
You villain!

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.660
U-Um... In that case, I can--

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:07.000
Not a chance. You've got
a broken bone, don't you?

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.830
You need to rest for a while.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.330
Oh, it's fine. I'm ambidextrous, so--

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.910
You need to rest.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.700
But my perfect attendance--

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.540
You need to rest.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.580
It'll be fine, Himiko.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:24.330
Anya can be snappy sometimes,
but he's actually very kind.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.790
I saw him spend a whole hour helping
a beetle find its way out of the tower.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.000
What?! Don't waste an hour
watching me do that!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.660
Hurry it up. We already drew lots.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:39.620
Shuddap! If you were in my shoes,
you'd be squealing and crying!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.830
I can assure you I don't squeal. Nor do I cry.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.750
Eh? Should I make you cry right now?

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:49.950
I know you're excited,
but let me continue the explanation.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:55.330
Though the stage difficulty is quite easy,
there is one taboo to be aware of.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.660
Taboo?

00:03:56.660 --> 00:04:01.410
You must not lie under any circumstance.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.750
It's getting narrower and narrower, isn't it?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:18.080
Hey, hurry it up. Don't fall behind. Tsk.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:23.120
He clicked his tongue at me! What do I do?
I don't wanna make him mad!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.660
That's scary!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.910
I know I said not to fall behind,
but this is damn close!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.950
Say something for crying out loud!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.790
Hey, talk or something.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:49.200
"Mom Switch ON"

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.290
"Mom Switch ON"
Kudou, have you been sleeping well lately?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.290
"Mom Switch ON"
Have you been taking your medicine?

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.790
Huh? What the...?

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:01.040
When we passed by the light,
your eye bags looked darker than usual.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.370
I'm sleeping.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.000
Are you being honest with me? Kudou?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.250
Give it a rest! I sleep like a log!

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.750
What was that just now?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.950
Shh! Stand back. Something's coming.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.250
Um, is it okay to be lounging like this?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:52.910
What else can we do? It's so dark
in there that the Pakameras won't go in.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.700
Even I'm worried about Ms. Inaba's well-being.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:00.410
Stuck all alone with a boy in a dark dungeon...

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.750
That Mr. Kudou better not get any ideas...

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.410
Wait, are you seriously hanging out with us?

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:09.370
Go somewhere else!
And bring me another pudding!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:14.000
Aren't you hot, Mr. Paka?
You're going to get dehydrated.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:18.500
No, it's okay. My entire body
was burned in the past...

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.330
...so I can't exactly expose my skin.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.620
I had no idea...

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.080
Onigasaki.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.330
Thanks.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:42.500
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.450
What other day?

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:46.910
Referring to the demon hideout.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.000
I lost my cool because of my sister.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.410
I just couldn't stay calm.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.620
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:08.290
Did you make any progress
finding your sister?

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:11.580
No. Though I did ask Paka about it later,

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.910
he insisted he didn't know anything.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.160
Of course he would.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:21.250
Oshigiri... What do you think about Iride?

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:25.790
Not much... I imagine he's
what a little brother might be like.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.540
That's not what I mean.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.580
Huh?

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.540
I'm honestly suspicious of him.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.040
Hey! What the hell are these!?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:38.790
We weren't supposed to lie in this dungeon...

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:42.580
If this is the punishment for
breaking the taboo, that means...

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:42.830
"Sheesh"

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:43.830
"Sheesh"
Sheesh! You lied to me
about sleeping well!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.040
Sheesh! You lied to me
about sleeping well!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.750
Is this any time to care about that?!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.750
What now?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.910
Go back or break through?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.080
Let's... break though.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:04.450
We'll wait for an opening
and slip right past them.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.790
All right. You're tiny, so you
can squeeze right through!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.790
Okay, here goes nothing!

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.200
The path!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.950
Just run for it!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.450
Kudou!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.080
You little...! Don't touch that!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.790
Idio...

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:49.290
Wh-Whoa!

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.410
Hey!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:56.080
You're kidding me!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.120
Heavy!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.370
Heavy?!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.040
Would you quit following me?

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.580
Cheapskate! Hurry up and leave then!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:13.040
--I hope your dad gets hypothermia!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.620
--He's yours, too, moron.
--I hope your dad gets hypothermia!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.750
Ken, I'm the one who's gotta deal with him.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:24.120
All right, all right. I'll buy you
ice cream on the way back.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.370
What you want, Shinya?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:26.410
Whatever.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.120
And you, Anya? Chocolate?

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.410
Chocolate mint.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.700
Got it!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.620
Stare...

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:56.290
You're too damn close!
And quit making that face!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:01.200
S-Sorry! I thought you might
be hurt or something...

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.040
Did I... say anything?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.580
Huh? No, not anything really...

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.080
You serious?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.830
I-I'm serious.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.160
Look in my eyes and say it.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.870
"Threatens men and women equally"

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.700
You yelled out "chocolate mint" and that's it!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.830
S-So I did say something!

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.330
Well, forget it!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.450
Karirin!

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:35.790
Jeez, would you cut that out?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:40.370
Aww, you're no fun.
And here we're finally alone...

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:42.870
Do you really need to keep up the act?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.250
It's Akatsuki that you like, isn't it?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.870
You don't have to use me to hide it.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.450
What, are you jealous or something?

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.120
I'm not jealous!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:56.000
I'm just saying that you don't
have to act like a clown all the time.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:00.750
Clown? I like it... Clowns are my role models.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:03.540
Soon you'll all think the same, too.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:06.500
You've all been chosen already.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.540
So you see...

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.790
Could I have some of your saliva?

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.660
Excuse me.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:17.660
Learn some manners, Kai. Need something?

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:22.120
Well, Kudou and Inaba
aren't done yet, you see.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.660
Iride's waiting at the ruins all depressed.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.790
What?! While holding his knees
like a little wet puppy?!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.790
Whimper...

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.040
Go hurry along and comfort him.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.160
Oh, all right! Thanks a bunch, Kai!

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.660
Did I interrupt?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:55.200
No, not at all. When it comes to him,
Yuzu can act so weird sometimes.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.330
Iride?

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.290
They said it's the first
time they've met, but...

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:06.040
I swear it's like they've
known each other for a while.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.200
The ceiling closed up on us...

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.540
Might be a good thing since
those things can't chase us.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:24.700
But the problem is, I don't
see a way out of this place.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.160
Huh?

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.200
It's like we're supposed to put our hands in.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.660
No way, something will happen.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:42.580
I don't wanna put my hands in there anyway.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.080
Why'd it have to be an alpaca?
Be a panda or something!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.160
Watch it. Quit with the kicking, fool.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.660
Huh?!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.370
Wh-What was that?!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.580
I'm right here.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.830
Oh, yeah? And where the hell is that?!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.620
Ouch!

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:03.330
Ow, ow, ow! That really hurt!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.370
Welcome, fools.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.330
It is time for your judgment.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:19.290
It is time for your judgment.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:22.910
Lies beget punishment. Truth begets reward.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:27.540
Ye who are lost within me,
your honesty shall be explored.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.080
In doing so--

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.750
Th-That hurts, you know!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.950
Shuddap! You talk awful
damn snobby for being a wall!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.950
Where's the exit, huh?

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.660
And dish out the Chromosome
while you're at it. You got it, yeah?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.000
This seems more like a shakedown...

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.580
Oh, really?

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.830
The ceiling!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.700
Hey! Stop it!

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.750
Goodbye, bald eyebrows.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.500
I hope you enjoy becoming a pancake.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.750
--Who you calling bald eyebrows, dammit?!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.330
--We're sorry! We'll listen
to what you have to say!
--Who you calling bald eyebrows, dammit?!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.500
--We're sorry! We'll listen
to what you have to say!
--You're just a wall! Who do you think you are?!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.200
You must answer my questions three.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.160
Huh?!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.580
Do so and you'll be rewarded.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.250
Question One: Memories.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.580
"Memories"
Question One: Memories.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:26.870
You must speak... your first love.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.540
"Your"
You must speak... your first love.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.580
You must speak... your first love.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.120
It is time you lay bare the truth.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.790
Kudou, stop it!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.620
It's really pissing me off!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:43.290
His attitude and face remind me of that jerk!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.160
What now, you oaf?

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.830
Don't you drop it on me!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.790
Besides, I have none!

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.790
Stop making things up
when we have to be honest!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.000
You spoke the truth.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.500
Huh?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.200
Hmm? What's so surprising?

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.750
N-Nothing...

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.950
He has none...

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.500
It is your turn, minuscule one.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:10.000
Huh? U-Um...

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.450
Go on and say it.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.500
Go on, go on...

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.450
H-He lived across the street...

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:25.330
H-His name was Gotanda
from the Whale Club!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.950
Don't!

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:32.950
Hmm? Your first love was bright
and brilliant like a bolt of lightning?

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.790
No! It was normal!

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:38.250
I gotta be careful not to piss her off...

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.830
Question Two: Personal.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.500
"Personal"
Question Two: Personal.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.040
That's disgusting!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.830
How rude of you to say.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:50.370
It's a personification creature--
a Kapakapa Slime.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:53.120
It reflects that which supports you.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:07.540
Can I help you with something, Mr. Oshigiri?

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:16.910
As I mentioned to you the other day,
I do not know anything about your sister.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:21.160
It's not about that. What did
you do to Roromori and them?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.910
I've been serving them
a bunch of sweets, but...

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:25.750
Don't play dumb. You--

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.660
Oh! There's something I wanted to mention.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:32.200
The cleaning of the White Room
has recently been completed.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.290
One of you may be able to enjoy it soon.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.790
Is that a threat?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.000
No, it is a warning.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.370
The White Room isn't just
for those disqualified.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:52.040
It's also for removing those who greatly
disturb the harmony of the game.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.370
But rest assured...

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:58.830
The top contender at this
point in time is Mr. Onigasaki.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.540
You little...!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.250
Aikawa.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.580
They're calling for you.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.660
Huh? H-Hey!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:16.000
That was an unexpected ambush.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:22.580
Hey, wait up, Aikawa. Who's calling for me?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.700
I lied.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.160
Wha...?

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.870
This is... Iride, isn't it?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.290
Why is he...?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:42.250
Oh? You both see the same thing?

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:43.160
Huh?

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.660
Question Two: Personal.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:51.250
Appearing before you is the form
of whom you're currently closest to.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.290
Wait a sec!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.750
You must speak five of their admirable traits.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.290
"Nice 2 Meet U"
You must speak five of their admirable traits.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:00.540
N-Nice to meet you.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.250
Can't believe you're holding that!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.950
Um...

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.750
Iride is kind, interesting...

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:10.540
...attentive, sincere, and I like
how he's like a big brother.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.040
Oh! In just five seconds flat...

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:14.950
I can say more!

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:16.290
And what about you?

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.700
Eh?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.660
Why do I gotta say something?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.120
Would you quit it?! I just
gotta say something, right?!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.080
Tsk!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.160
Give it your best shot, Kudou!
Just five things!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.660
I know that!

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:44.700
Um! Uh...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.910
I think he's kinda interesting, too, but...

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:50.500
What the hell?!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:54.370
I don't like when people are
wishy-washy. I like decisiveness.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.750
It's just your preference?! Cut it out!

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.450
Don't cheer me up, I'll get distracted!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.330
Shit...

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:14.910
Um, um...

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.410
Mornings...

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.250
...he comes to wake me up.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.120
And he eats all my peppers...

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:23.120
When I can't sleep, he hangs out
and plays games with me...

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.750
A-And...

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.660
He doesn't treat me differently
even though I'm sick.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:43.410
Very well. That was pleasantly decisive.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.830
Now for the final question.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.410
"Confessional"

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.700
It's beautiful...

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.910
I hope... I can collect them all soon.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:58.330
Akki.

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.330
Yuzu!

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:12.290
I talked to Mr. Paka, but he said if nothing
went wrong, they'd be back in an hour.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.370
Yeah.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.660
Do you think if I went in,
Mr. Paka would get mad at me?

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.410
Probably. I'd get mad, too.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.410
Eh?

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:23.410
You're not suited for this dungeon at all.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:26.580
Ugh... They really are holding their knees.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:29.410
So much for Roro trying to cheer him up.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.290
You all came, huh?

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:32.910
Don't you worry.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:37.120
In the rare chance something happens,
Paka will do something about it.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.000
Besides, Kudou is as tough as a cockroach.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.160
Who you calling a cockroach, eh?!

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.290
Don't you be slandering me!

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.870
We're back!

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:50.250
It's Himiko! And Anya!

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:51.830
Anya!

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:03.620
Final Question: Confessional.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.370
You must speak your sin.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.540
I...

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:14.950
I... killed my big brother.
